title: '[pallet-revive] Preserve total issuance in dry-run calls'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Runtime User]
  description: |-
    `dry_run_eth_transact` no longer includes its temporary fee credit in
    `Currency::total_issuance()`. Contracts querying native supply during `eth_call` or gas
    estimation now observe the same issuance as a real transaction. No migration is needed.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
